CLI.md §2.3: --lang names a language; one the project does not list is not an error (the source language answers).
-- args --
check
--lang
xx
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a

const = 1
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
error[E1116]  a/a.canon:3:7
  expected IDENT; found =

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
[stderr]
